WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:01.640 --> 00:02.950
Hi Victoria!

2
00:03.050 --> 00:07.330
I wanted to give you a rundown of your project
for the next couple of weeks before our team meeting.

3
00:07.880 --> 00:11.970
We're releasing the new app in four weeks and
need to make sure everyone is on the same page.

4
00:12.610 --> 00:16.550
Do you mind drafting up a work plan for the next
month and getting feedback from the rest of the team?

5
00:17.290 --> 00:18.530
Ah, sure.

6
00:19.850 --> 00:21.700
I have no idea how to get started on this work.

7
00:22.470 --> 00:27.460
I'm used to planning and execution, not brainstorming
different solutions and getting input from different individuals.

8
00:27.940 --> 00:30.110
This problem has so many moving pieces.

9
00:30.690 --> 00:31.970
I should ask my manager for help.

10
00:32.550 --> 00:33.410
Everything okay?

11
00:34.120 --> 00:36.580
I was just wondering if you could
help me get started on this work.

12
00:36.930 --> 00:39.940
I'm having trouble breaking down all
the pieces of work that need to get done.

13
00:40.810 --> 00:41.600
No worries at all.

14
00:42.370 --> 00:45.890
There are a few different things we want to
evaluate when we're trying to solve a problem.

15
00:47.110 --> 00:48.960
What are we trying to solve exactly?

16
00:50.470 --> 00:53.440
What does the end goal look like,
and how do we get there?
